---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import H1 from '../../components/H1.astro';
import H2 from '../../components/H2.astro';
import Main from '../../components/Main.astro';
import Table from '../../components/ui/Table.astro';
import WorksImg from '../../components/ui/WorksImg.astro';
import BtnBack from '../../components/ui/BtnBack.astro'
---

<Layout title="謎のページ | cascade-path">
	<Header />
	<H1>制作実績:「謎のページ」</H1>
    <Main>
        <WorksImg SRC="https://portfolio.cascade-path.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/53f16113fe0240234c96b26680412811-edited-1.jpeg" />
        <Table rows={[
            { left: "公開日", right: "2026年3月" },
            { left: "規模", right: "2ページ" },
            { left: "技術", right: "HTML/CSS" },
            { left: "制作期間", right: "1日" },
            { left: "制作環境", right: "VS Code" },
            { left: "公開リンク", right: "https://github.com/cascade-path/info" },
        ]} />
        <div>CSS電卓の解説ページを突貫工事で作ったら、怪しい技術ブログになりました。</div>
        <H2>制作過程</H2>
        <h2>まとめ</h2>
        <BtnBack HREF="/works">一覧に戻る</BtnBack>
    <Footer />
</Layout>